BJtNfb0Ymd5WbXO_NrVzvza0\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964491668575227904564823.png/eFEtF5LmMxRNurI_BWLi_SpyMaWsuMa1y5d8CcuXfAk\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964491670827700224398406.png/PcUR18yctil0ygF-toYyQqIKy9RHcjYmZTnoumU56Lo\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964491673591877632632058.png/AfMHEeAt1U-noRXADQca0QuzR6hao1kk3ww_I98MPyM\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠superjunior）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠tntonyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964491676070842368025478.png/b6xjQneybotXwcS94qQpk1I59N3I1XNBL7Wy8S-1svE\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠tntonyan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠tntonyan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250207/964491678243622912527968.png/n-PbPHWrqqwtkyqP0Sfb4tBGdVZFhdW0OgjN0zoIzdM\"/><figcaption>11位韓偶像「藝名超荒謬」（01製圖／IG＠tntonyan）</figcaption></figure><p>延伸閲讀：</p><p>韓國捐水給熊本遭酸！日網友譏「只能沖馬桶」引口水戰</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:24.417932+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2187,"images":41,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none"}}